# SmartDialer

### Predictive + Progressive Collections Dialer with Deterministic Safety Controls

SmartDialer is a Python-based dialer prototype that explores how predictive dialing can improve agent utilization while maintaining the safety and concurrency guarantees of progressive dialing.

![SmartDialer UI]()

---

## What is SmartDialer?

In a traditional progressive dialer, one available agent is assigned to one outbound call.

Predictive dialing improves utilization by starting more calls than there are available agents, based on the expected answer rate.

The challenge is what happens when multiple borrowers answer at the same time and there are not enough agents available.

SmartDialer solves this by placing a **Safety Controller** between the pacing engine and the dialing system.

```text
Pacing Engine
      ↓
Safety Controller
      ↓
Call Allocator
      ↓
Telecom Provider
      ↓
Call Events
      ↓
Call State Machine
